  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(155)/(0.155) = (15.5)/(K)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(155)/(0.155) = (15.5)/(K)\n\n⇒ 155 × K = 15.5 × 0.155\n\n⇒ 155K = 15.5 × 0.155\n\n⇒ K = (15.5 × 0.155)/(155)\n\n⇒ K = 0.0155\n\n**The correct answer is option 3.**",
